    <div class="hero-main"><div class="eyebrow">// independent security research</div><h1>XER<br/><em>OG</em></h1><p class="hero-copy">I break things apart to understand how they were built. This is the public record — security research, CTFs, tooling, experiments and the occasional rabbit hole.</p></div>
    <aside class="hero-side"><div class="stamp">NODE: XEROG<br/>MODE: RESEARCH<br/>STACK: WEB / PWN / RE</div><div class="cross">+</div><div class="stamp">LAST UPDATED<br/><strong>17.09.2026</strong></div></aside>
  </section>
  <section class="section" id="work"><div class="section-head"><h2>Selected work</h2><span>01 — 04</span></div><div class="work-list">
    <a class="work" href="/writeups"><span class="work-no">01</span><span class="work-title">Writeups &amp; field notes</span><span class="work-meta">CTF / WEB / PWN</span><span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
