  <section class="grid">
    <article class="card"><span class="num">PROJECT / 001</span><div><span class="tag">javascript secrets</span><h3>JSX</h3><p>A lightweight scanner for secrets hiding in JavaScript. JWTs, cloud keys, Firebase configs and more.</p></div></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="num">PROJECT / 002</span><div><span class="tag">recon</span><h3>RetroRecon</h3><p>Turning historical web data into something useful for reconnaissance and investigation.</p></div></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="num">PROJECT / 003</span><div><span class="tag">ongoing</span><h3>Rang De</h3><p>A personal bug-bounty workspace for testing ideas, collecting observations and shipping them.</p></div></article>
