  <section class="section"><div class="about-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">// principle</div><p>No “expert” badges. No inflated skill bars. The work should be enough to show what I can do.</p></div><div class="mono">01 / READ THE SYSTEM<br/>02 / BREAK THE ASSUMPTION<br/>03 / DOCUMENT THE PATH<br/>04 / BUILD SOMETHING BETTER</div></div></section>
